OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOutbreaks of heavy and thundery
OL,6,Frain over Speyside and Nairn will
OL,7,Fquickly clear eastwards. The rest of
OL,8,Fthe day will be mainly cloudy with a
OL,9,Ffew showers feeding in from the west.
OL,10,FBest of the brightness near the
OL,11,FCromarty Firth.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening with
OL,14,Ffurther showers which will continue to
OL,15,Fmove in from the west overnight. Some
OL,16,Fclear spells developing later.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSaturday:FA mixture of bright
OL,19,Fintervals and scattered showers. Best
OL,20,Fof the sunny spells across Inverness
OL,21,Fand Speyside.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
