OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with more scattered showers on
OL,7,FSunday. A dry start to Monday then
OL,8,Frain spreading east. Showers or longer
OL,9,Fspells of rain on Tuesday.
